HB0241 Telehealth Freedom Act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Smith, S and Kelly and Senator(s)
Pearson
AN ACT relating to professions and occupations; authorizing health care
providers to provide telehealth services to persons in Wyoming without a Wyoming
license; providing requirements; requiring rulemaking; making conforming
amendments; and providing for effective dates.
